    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the screen time though. it's the air i breathe. it's the way the world feels like it's already moved on and just left a hole where i used to be. it feels so much more logical to just... accept it. like, if the world has already decided i'm nothing, why am i still trying to fight to exist in it? it feels like i'm just prolonging something that's already finished.",
